codex
The current API is controller-and-in-memory-repository based. I’ll keep that shape: add an order lifecycle enum, coordinate cancellation in the order controller with a preflight check before any writes, and make shipment creation consult the order repository only when that order exists. The existing “shipment for unknown order” behavior will remain unchanged.
